{"unit_id":"blueberrymaid__dsh-midtalk#card-zh","repo":"blueberrymaid/dsh-midtalk","commit":"feee0b91840e804b7104f6743673e40be85a3aee","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-midtalk 是一个面向 DSH 的任务中插话与步骤控制插件，通过 Cordis 注册 /say 和 /cut 两条命令。运行中的会话可用 /say 将补充内容送到下一个步骤边界，保留当前步骤继续执行；需要立即停止时可用 /cut 中止当前步骤，并在发送后续消息前写出按会话区分的结构化恢复卡。恢复卡包含中断位置、待处理工具调用、最近的文本与流帧；插件也会记录启动标记和唤醒日志。它适合需要在长任务期间补充指令或查看中断现场的 DSH 用户。插件读取可选的 DSH_HOME，未设置时使用 ~/.dsh；需要 Node.js 22 或更新版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:164-223","index.js:90-103","lib/core.js:184-219","index.js:49"]}
{"unit_id":"blueberrymaid__dsh-midtalk#card-en","repo":"blueberrymaid/dsh-midtalk","commit":"feee0b91840e804b7104f6743673e40be85a3aee","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-midtalk adds /say to deliver a message at the next step boundary without stopping the current step, and /cut to stop it and save a session recovery card with recent activity. It writes boot and wake logs under DSH_HOME (default ~/.dsh) and requires Node.js 22+.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:164-223","index.js:90-103","lib/core.js:184-219","index.js:49"]}
