{"unit_id":"blueberrymaid__dsh-midtalk#feature-say","repo":"blueberrymaid/dsh-midtalk","commit":"feee0b91840e804b7104f6743673e40be85a3aee","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-midtalk 的功能「无损插话」：/say 将输入包装成插话消息并送入当前 agent，在下一个步骤边界处理，不取消当前步骤。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:176-182","lib/core.js:209-213"]}
