{"unit_id":"blueberrymaid__dsh-midtalk#caveat-queue","repo":"blueberrymaid/dsh-midtalk","commit":"feee0b91840e804b7104f6743673e40be85a3aee","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-midtalk 使用待送话队列；队列超过 8 条时会移除最早的一条，并将丢弃记录写入 wake.log。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:129-145","lib/core.js:18-20"]}
